    <string name="core_ui_kit_setbar_remove">− set</string>
    <!--
      The discard SHEET's four strings (§26, "Every modal on the three editors is a SHEET").
      ONE TABLE, in the kit, because one component serves all three editors — a per-feature copy
      is how the same sheet ends up saying two different things on two screens. The Russian is the
      drawing verbatim (`pass2d.html` `#s-editor` form 3) and the English follows it.

      The dismiss label is «Продолжить правку» and not «Отмена»: «Отмена» reads as closing the
      window rather than as declining to discard, which is the wrong thing to promise on the
      gentle branch.
    -->
    <string name="core_ui_kit_discard_sheet_title">Leave without saving?</string>
    <string name="core_ui_kit_discard_sheet_body">Unsaved edits will be lost.</string>
    <string name="core_ui_kit_discard_sheet_confirm">Leave without saving</string>
    <string name="core_ui_kit_discard_sheet_dismiss">Keep editing</string>
